~
                                                             * HELP *~
~
~
  CONTROLS : ~
~
    [Z] | [↑] : UP~
    [Q] | [←] : LEFT~
    [S] | [↓] : DOWN~
    [D] | [→] : RIGHT~
~
    [LEFT CLICK] : USE WEAPON~
    [RIGHT CLICK] : USE CONSUMABLE ITEM~
~
    [W] : DROP ITEM~
~
    [E] : EXAMINE ITEM~
~
    [H] : SHOW THIS PAGE~
    [A] : ACHIEVEMENTS~
    [T] : STATISTICS~
~
    [SPACE] : PAUSE THE GAME~
~
  TIPS : ~
~
    BOWS : To use a bow, hold it in your hand and left-click.~
    KEYS : To use a key, hold it in your hand and collide with a chest of the same rarity~
        or right click the chest with a key of matching rarity in your inventory.~
    Chests are represented by the first letter of their rank.~
    Pay close attention to your score and your character's well-being.~